WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.220
Forward heavy punch lands as a Punish Counter.

2
00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:01.900
A separate back heavy punch links directly after forward heavy.

3
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.650
Heavy-punch Sonic Hurricane launches Manon.

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.450
Guile takes the source-labelled short forward walk after Hurricane.

5
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.650
OD Flash Kick catches the falling opponent at the adjusted spacing.

6
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:05.720
Manon lands after the OD kick.
